{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583820/extras/a7cf7a2820cd5145d46764954533a31f.avif?t=1755847261\" width=780 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaks in Space is a 2D space sim featuring Combat, Ship building, Mining and Exploring the galaxy where every hit risks your ship suffering a fatal leak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ship Building</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583820/extras/32e046eb075500af132630bb6f9ffe40.poster.avif?t=1755847261\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583820/extras/32e046eb075500af132630bb6f9ffe40.webm?t=1755847261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583820/extras/32e046eb075500af132630bb6f9ffe40.mp4?t=1755847261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and customize</strong> <strong>your ship</strong> with tons of unique parts. Equip  railguns, versatile turrets, and other exciting modifiable weapons. Fortify your core with armor plating, energy shields, and specialized modules to survive the harshest corners of space.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Space Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583820/extras/e0fb4e150f90b60326e7c4156b5c230d.poster.avif?t=1755847261\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583820/extras/e0fb4e150f90b60326e7c4156b5c230d.webm?t=1755847261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583820/extras/e0fb4e150f90b60326e7c4156b5c230d.mp4?t=1755847261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intense space battles against relentless drones, ruthless space pirates, and colossal space-dwelling creatures. These alien lifeforms are not humanoid but living hazards of the void, like the ore-devouring amoebas that split into swarms  lurking between the stars.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Gathering</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583820/extras/209b24d55a3f734a06c069b97ca33e61.poster.avif?t=1755847261\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583820/extras/209b24d55a3f734a06c069b97ca33e61.webm?t=1755847261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583820/extras/209b24d55a3f734a06c069b97ca33e61.mp4?t=1755847261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine asteroids, scavenge the wreckage of destroyed ships. Discover the fate of fallen crews you find in the forgotten battlefields. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In this outlaw universe, survival depends on being both the fittest and the smartest. Come prepared, fight strategically, and make sure you remain the hunter rather than the prey!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepageba